    "body": "## Summary\n- add optional private center point + 1–100 km radius to saved searches\n- validate complete coordinate/radius tuples and persist them as PostGIS geography\n- include radius in saved-search matching without exposing private coordinates in public jobs or notification bodies\n- add Flyway V23, backend tests and privacy documentation\n\n## Privacy / safety\n- center coordinates are returned only from the authenticated saved-search API to the owning user\n- alert notifications still contain only public job information\n- private address labels, route geometry and live tracking remain excluded\n\n## Validation\nRun full Maven verify, frontend lint/build, Flyway/PostgreSQL runtime smoke and existing payments/ledger gates. Do not merge unless required checks are green.",
